{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17752","headline":"和大夫边春呈长安亲故 · 杨巨源","name":"和大夫边春呈长安亲故","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"严城吹笛思寒梅，二月冰河一半开。\n紫陌诗情依旧在，黑山弓力畏春来。\n游人曲岸看花发，走马平沙猎雪回。\n旌斾朝天不知晚，将星高处近三台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17752.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17752","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}